#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/editing-hci-validation.bpmn:279
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Process_BeanClose: end the bean in a state that says why — complete and archive it, scrap it with its reasons and archive it, or record the blocker and hand it back. The one place resolve and archive are drawn; placed straight before the end so the engine's resolve sees nothing left but the archive step."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/editing-hci-validation.bpmn:102
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Process_BeanOpen: check before you create, find out whose the bean is, and claim it — or leave it alone when it is someone else's. The one place a claim is drawn; the gateway after this reads which end it reached."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/editing-hci-validation.bpmn:56
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Produces the proposed change and, once findings exist, weighs the options for it — accept, revise, discard — but stops short of choosing: Call_OptionsAnalysis records that the options were weighed, Task_RecordDecision in the editor's lane records what was chosen, so one party never both analyses and decides."
msgstr ""

